# Grid and arm specs describe a REAL plan: retirement dates, spending levels, asset
# values. That is private, and there is no reason for it to be in version control.
#
# So: everything here is ignored except the committed `example-*.json` files, which
# use round synthetic figures and exist to document the format. Keep your own specs
# here under any other name and they stay local.
*.json
!example-*.json
